  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen a Group has their Galleries set to Private you normally should only be able to see them while being a member of that Group. This is not the case though, after leaving the Group you are still able to see the pictures in their Galleries. I was also able to see newly added images after having left that Group as well, and was able to do so in multiple browsers, so this is **not** just a caching issue.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nWhen a Group Gallery is set to being Private you should only be able to see it while actually being a member of that Group and not also after having left that Group.\n\n# Attachments:\n\n1. Shows the Gallery before having joined:\n\n2. Shows the Gallery while being a Member:\n\n3. Shows the Gallery after having left it:",
